1. `npx vitest run`: your 3 test files pass (plus everyone else's). Type check and lint are clean.
2. http://localhost:3000/dev/submission-ui-test: the first button logs on click; the "Checking..." and disabled buttons look faded and do nothing; a two-bullet list shows below.

