**The feature:** a learner asks a question (a **doubt**); it lands in a queue; a **mentor** sees open doubts oldest first and replies; the learner then sees the reply. A **Learner / Mentor** switch flips the same page between the two views. Built on mock data saved in the browser's `localStorage`, so both views share data and it survives a reload.

